        "Overview"
      ],
      "Text": "To make error messages more actionable, we have introduced a standardized error response schema that includes:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Overview",
      "Anchor": "overview",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Overview"
      ],
      "Text": "New error response fields: errorDetailType and errorDetails.\nStandard HTTP status codes that will be specific to the error.\nUpdated messages which are clear, actionable, and structured.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Overview",
      "Anchor": "overview",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Overview"
      ],
      "Text": "By providing a machine-readable error response schema, you can know exactly how to troubleshoot and be able to programmatically fix the error. These changes should make it easier for you to debug effectively on your own.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
